{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They took everything. The ship is all you have left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track them down through the remains of Earth and stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/919ac7880055f1892950a5c354a5c219.poster.avif?t=1770893260\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/919ac7880055f1892950a5c354a5c219.webm?t=1770893260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/919ac7880055f1892950a5c354a5c219.mp4?t=1770893260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><br><br>What <strong>is</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss encounters with each their own mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive arcade flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast environments to get lost in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, eerie, dreamlike mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ethereal soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/2b32ac95cd28032324d08304bdc03bd2.poster.avif?t=1770893260\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/2b32ac95cd28032324d08304bdc03bd2.webm?t=1770893260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/2b32ac95cd28032324d08304bdc03bd2.mp4?t=1770893260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What <strong>is not</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No regular enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a flight sim, not a rail shooter either</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In a nutshell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can think of <strong><i>They Took the Sun</i></strong> as a mix between 90s arcade flight games and Team Ico\u2019s <i>Shadow of the Colossus</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabe Miller - Art &amp; Design <br>Julien Ribassin - Code, Audio &amp; Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/8e70d1eed63c9abcefbf3642f9fdde0c.avif?t=1770893260\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889510?t=1770893260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889510?t=1770893260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/355e2162ee80a2d4dfbbfb2cfa497fce256b09cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770893260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/355e2162ee80a2d4dfbbfb2cfa497fce256b09cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770893260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They took everything. The ship is all you have left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track them down through the remains of Earth and stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/919ac7880055f1892950a5c354a5c219.poster.avif?t=1770893260\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/919ac7880055f1892950a5c354a5c219.webm?t=1770893260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/919ac7880055f1892950a5c354a5c219.mp4?t=1770893260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><br><br>What <strong>is</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss encounters with each their own mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive arcade flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast environments to get lost in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, eerie, dreamlike mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ethereal soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/2b32ac95cd28032324d08304bdc03bd2.poster.avif?t=1770893260\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass